er character? The pose and expression can be whatever you like!\n\nReferences:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1c_Qq4nW7uZaqPFd2x-AULr2_D5ltBlPR?usp=sharing\nhttps://docs.google.com/drawings/d/14WR9pIFJ4bYFZxEGjGwYFgf9Ka8bSZIu-U3K3Mymp_M/edit", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oxoi0x0/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8d629e7e/uploads/origins/4949c499-5f3f-49e2-85ca-a149b633f8dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9252f3ee704b6e44c994ff86d2bb44cc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8d629e7e/uploads/origins/4949c499-5f3f-49e2-85ca-a149b633f8dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9252f3ee704b6e44c994ff86d2bb44cc, https://si.imgix.net/8d629e7e/uploads/origins/4949c499-5f3f-49e2-85ca-a149b633f8dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=18bba6274c77f783e975fb37cab82062 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8d629e7e/uploads/origins/4949c499-5f3f-49e2-85ca-a149b633f8dc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a2acd9efb4888afc930aedf188047fb 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、オリキャラになりますがイラストをリクエストさせていただきたいです\nURL先の２枚目風鞠ケイをお願いしたいです、膝丈までの長髪に３本の蛍光色のラインの入った女の子になります。\nクールな感じで服装はオーバーサイズのジャージを着せてもらえれば構図等はお任せさせていただきたいです\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/98434628", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@oxoi0x0/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d3f94cf6/uploads/origins/d1b22c4d-9c19-476e-a79b-0349fce2cbc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27652f40cea99e18449daac6a312b905", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d3f94cf6/uploads/origins/d1b22c4d-9c19-476e-a79b-0349fce2cbc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=27652f40cea99e18449daac6a312b905, https://si.imgix.net/d3f94cf6/uploads/origins/d1b22c4d-9c19-476e-a79b-0349fce2cbc4?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&